[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0010","text":"制作人，今天有什么事吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0020","text":"重要的事情是……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0030","text":"……啊……抱歉\n再等我一下"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0040","text":"──等再凑齐一个人\n我想开始谈正事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0050","text":"…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0052","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0060","text":"────…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0070","text":"…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0080","text":"喂……到底什么事啊──……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0090","text":"……！\n……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0100","text":"……我想让你们３个人，组成一个组合"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0110","text":"诶——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0120","text":"…………之前，收到了一个演唱会活动的邀请"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0130","text":"主题是『新时代』────\n说是在寻找适合肩负未来的偶像"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0140","text":"这个演唱会活动\n希望你们３个人──以组合的形式，出演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0150","text":"组合名是──……CoMETIK"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0160","text":"…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0170","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0180","text":"羽那、阳希……路加"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0190","text":"对你们３个人各自的未来来说，\n都会是一次重要的挑战……我是这么想的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0191","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0200","text":"…………时间到了\n──各位，开始吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0201","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08010000_99_0202","text":"Motion"}]
